---
// The governing principle, drawn: standard work flows through automatically,
// exceptions go to a person with context, and both end in the same place.
---
<figure>
  <svg class="flow" viewBox="0 0 480 340" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-title flow-desc">
    <title id="flow-title">How a buildIntersect system routes work</title>
    <desc id="flow-desc">Incoming requests pass through explicit rules. Standard cases are handled automatically. Exceptions go to a named person with the context attached. Both paths end in done, and every exception improves the rules.</desc>

    <!-- inbound -->
    <rect class="node" x="10" y="146" width="104" height="48" rx="10" />
    <text x="62" y="167" text-anchor="middle">Requests</text>
    <text class="sub" x="62" y="183" text-anchor="middle">WhatsApp, email</text>
    <path class="ln" d="M114 170 H150" />

    <!-- rules -->
    <rect class="node-accent" x="150" y="140" width="96" height="60" rx="10" />
    <text x="198" y="166" text-anchor="middle">Rules</text>
    <text class="sub" x="198" y="183" text-anchor="middle">written down</text>

    <!-- standard path -->
    <path class="ln-accent" d="M246 162 C 290 162, 290 76, 330 76 H344" />
    <rect class="node-accent" x="344" y="52" width="126" height="48" rx="10" />
    <text x="407" y="73" text-anchor="middle">Automated</text>
    <text class="sub" x="407" y="89" text-anchor="middle">standard cases</text>

    <!-- exception path -->
    <path class="ln-dash" d="M246 178 C 290 178, 290 264, 330 264 H344" />
    <rect class="node" x="344" y="240" width="126" height="48" rx="10" />
    <text x="407" y="261" text-anchor="middle">A person</text>
    <text class="sub" x="407" y="277" text-anchor="middle">exceptions, with context</text>

    <!-- feedback: exceptions improve the rules -->
    <path class="ln-dash" d="M344 280 C 250 330, 198 300, 198 200" />
    <circle class="dot" cx="198" cy="203" r="3" />
    <text class="sub" x="236" y="318" text-anchor="middle">each exception sharpens the rules</text>

    <!-- labels -->
    <text class="sub" x="300" y="40" text-anchor="middle">most of the volume</text>
    <text class="sub" x="300" y="226" text-anchor="middle">the few that matter</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="flow-caption">Automate what is completely standard. Route the exceptions to people. Keep the boundary explicit.</figcaption>
</figure>
